 "description": "<p>A leather collar pairing a bow with a big bell, in white or black, adjusting through 40-50 cm. The bow-and-bell combination is the classic cat-accessory formula, executed in real leather rather than costume ribbon.</p>\n<p>The big bell is deliberately audible - a soft ring at movement, not a clang. The bow sits above it per the pictures, and the leather base keeps both anchored.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar</li>\n<li>Style: bow with big bell</li>\n<li>Color: white or black</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Two colorways, one classic formula. The bow collar for cat-ear headbands that arrived without their neck piece.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Leather collar with bow and big bell in white or black, adjustable 40-50 cm, classic cat formula.</p>\n",
